  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKTP - The Democratic Republic of Congo Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase trade between the DRC and the UK/EU markets, while also 
fostering greater intra-African trade. This will contribute to the creation, maintenance, and improvement of employment opportunities for both men and women within the coffee, cocoa, and spices sectors as well as services sectors such technology.</narrative>
  </description>
